#: olang/009c9ea4/0x3ca19f/0xf9f7f5
#: olang/00d345a5/0x048941/0x000184
#: olang/00d345a5/0x048941/0x00018b
msgid "Variation of Naked with camouflage pants. Raises camo index in environments of a similar color, but only half as much as full-body camo."
msgstr "裸装加迷彩裤。在相近颜色的环境中提升迷彩指数，但效果仅为全身迷彩的一半。"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x3ca19f/0x19f7f8
msgid ""
"A gold T-shirt.\n"
"The basic characteristics are\n"
"the same as the Jungle Fatigues."
msgstr "金色T恤。\n基本性能与\n丛林迷彩服相同。"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x3ca19f/0x29f7f8
msgid ""
"A T-shirt with a Love Box design.\n"
"The basic characteristics are\n"
"the same as the Jungle Fatigues."
msgstr "爱之箱图案T恤。\n基本性能与\n丛林迷彩服相同。"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x3ca19f/0x49f7f4
msgid "Variation of Jungle Fatigues camouflage. Raises camo index near water."
msgstr "丛林迷彩服变种。在水边提升迷彩指数。"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x3ca19f/0x59f7f4
msgid "Variation of Jungle Fatigues camouflage. Raises camo index in environments with a lot of wooden buildings."
msgstr "丛林迷彩服变种。在木质建筑多的环境中提升迷彩指数。"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x3ca19f/0xc9f7f5
msgid "Variation of Jungle Fatigues camouflage. Raises camo index slightly when standing on jungle or dirt surfaces."
msgstr "丛林迷彩服变种。站在丛林或泥土地面时略微提升迷彩指数。"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x3ca19f/0xd9f7f5
msgid "Variation of Jungle Fatigues camouflage. Slightly increases the diameter of the CO-OPS boundary line."
msgstr "丛林迷彩服变种。略微扩大合作任务边界线直径。"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x3ca19f/0xd9f7f7
msgid "Variation of Naked with camouflage pants. Raises camo index near water, but only half as much as full-body camo."
msgstr "裸装加迷彩裤。在水边提升迷彩指数，但效果仅为全身迷彩的一半。"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x3ca19f/0xe9f7f5
msgid "Variation of Jungle Fatigues camouflage. Slightly increases gun performance."
msgstr "丛林迷彩服变种。略微提升枪械性能。"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x3ca19f/0xe9f7f7
msgid "Variation of Naked with camouflage pants. Raises camo index in environments with a lot of wooden buildings, but only half as much as full-body camo."
msgstr "裸装加迷彩裤。在木质建筑多的环境中提升迷彩指数，但效果仅为全身迷彩的一半。"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x3ca19f/0xf9f7f7
msgid "Variation of Naked with camouflage pants. Raises camo index when standing on jungle or dirt surfaces, but only half as much as full-body camo."
msgstr "裸装加迷彩裤。站在丛林或泥土地面时提升迷彩指数，但效果仅为全身迷彩的一半。"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x3ced95/0x155479
msgid ""
"The game is currently paused.\n"
"Skip the cutscene and proceed?"
msgstr ""
"游戏当前已暂停。\n"
"要跳过这段过场吗？"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x413acf/0x052bda
msgid ""
"Revolution is a means and not an end, I know.\n"
"When the revolution is victorious, I want my\n"
"country to be at peace. But to bring peace,\n"
"we have to first eliminate that traitorous scum."
msgstr "我知道，革命是手段而非目的。\n革命胜利后，我希望我的\n祖国安宁。但要带来和平，\n必须先消灭那些叛徒渣滓。"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x413acf/0x06b55b
msgid ""
"We go where we're needed, \n"
"fighting not for country, not for government,\n"
"but for ourselves.\n"
msgstr "我们奔赴需要我们的地方，\n不为国家，不为政府，\n只为自己。\n"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x413acf/0x21f416
msgid ""
"My name is Paz, and I will do anything\n"
"to protect my namesake. \n"
"It is my one and only purpose."
msgstr "我叫帕兹，我会不惜一切\n守护我的同名之物。\n这是我唯一的目的。"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x413acf/0x374f9e
msgid ""
"That's why I agreed to help develop it... \n"
"Mm-hmm. However, in order to achieve\n"
"that perfect deterrent, \n"
"we must show the world our strength."
msgstr "所以我同意协助开发它……\n嗯嗯。但是，要实现\n那种完美的威慑力，\n我们必须向世界展示实力。"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x413acf/0x91c53e
msgid ""
"Yes, I know. Just as I know \n"
"what you did 10 years ago.\n"
"Go on, kill me like you killed her.\n"
"Kill me like you killed The Boss.\n"
"Kill me!"
msgstr "是的，我知道。就像我知道\n你10年前做了什么。\n来吧，像杀她那样杀了我。\n像杀THE BOSS那样杀了我。\n杀了我！"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x413acf/0x91c540
msgid ""
"You used the pretext of a mission \n"
"to kill a true hero.\n"
"Is that what you call loyalty? Answer me!"
msgstr "你借任务之名\n杀害了一位真正的英雄。\n这就是你所谓的忠诚？回答我！"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x413acf/0x91c541
msgid ""
"I won't rest until I get answers \n"
"from the woman I loved. \n"
"You and I are the same. We are the walking dead."
msgstr "得不到答案\n我绝不罢休 为了我爱过的女人\n你我一样 都是行尸走肉"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x413acf/0xb2d965
msgid ""
"...Everyone treats me like a child.\n"
"I, I, I couldn't stand it anymore. \n"
"I'm not a kid. I'm twelve! "
msgstr "……大家都把我当小孩。\n我、我受不了了。\n我不是小鬼。我十二岁！"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x413acf/0xb949dc
msgid ""
"Becoming one with the forest is the very essence of\n"
"birdwatching, they won't behave naturally if they\n"
"sense a human nearby. And that can really affect your\n"
"observations."
msgstr ""

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x413acf/0xd1f416
msgid ""
"Exactly. We know only how to fight... \n"
"but we refuse to live our lives at the whim of the state."
msgstr "没错。我们只会战斗……\n但绝不愿任国家摆布地活着。"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x413acf/0xd1f417
msgid ""
"No one man could bear the burden of total genocide. \n"
"It's what's allowed our cowardly species to survive all this time."
msgstr "没人能背负种族灭绝的全部罪孽。\n正因如此 我们懦弱的种族才活到今天。"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x413acf/0xd1f418
msgid ""
"You've left everything behind - your country, your identity,\n"
"your past and ideals... \n"
"But there's still one thing you haven't let go of."
msgstr "你抛下了一切——祖国、身份、\n过去和理想……\n但有一样东西你还没放下。"

