msgid ""
"Press <I=CONF> to specify the team to which\n"
"to assign the soldier."
msgstr "按<I=CONF>指定要\n分配该士兵的小队。"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x5f753b/0x28adbe
msgid "Rotate: <I=CAMERA> left/right"
msgstr "旋转：<I=CAMERA> 左右"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x5f753b/0x28adbf
msgid "Move: <I=CAMERA> up/down"
msgstr "移动<I=CAMERA>上下"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x5f753b/0x48adbe
#: olang/009c9ea4/0x5f753b/0xc992ce
#: olang/009c9ea4/0x919326/0xc992ce
msgid "Rotate: <I=CAMERA>"
msgstr "旋转<I=CAMERA>"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x5f753b/0x88adbf
#: olang/009c9ea4/0x5f753b/0xa8adbe
msgid "Move Camera: <I=CAMERA>"
msgstr "移动镜头<I=CAMERA>"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x5f753b/0xc992cf
msgid "Move: <I=CAMERA>"
msgstr "移动：<I=CAMERA>"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x629bfd/0x000001
msgid ""
"Use up and down on <I=CAMERA> \n"
"to move your line of sight!"
msgstr "使用<I=CAMERA>的上下方向键\n来移动你的视线！"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x629c7d/0x000001
msgid ""
"Use right and left on <I=CAMERA> \n"
"to move your line of sight!"
msgstr "用<I=CAMERA>左右键\n移动视线！"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x62a7fd/0x000000
msgid ""
"Boss, \n"
"use up and down on <I=CAMERA> \n"
"to move your line of sight."
msgstr "Boss，\n用<I=CAMERA>上下键\n移动视线。"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x62a7fd/0x000001
msgid ""
"use the up and down <I=CAMERA> \n"
"to move your line of sight.  "
msgstr "用<I=CAMERA>上下键\n移动视线。"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x62a87d/0x000000
msgid ""
"Boss, \n"
"use left and right on <I=CAMERA> \n"
"to move your line of sight!"
msgstr "Boss，\n用<I=CAMERA>左右键\n移动视线！"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x62a87d/0x000001
msgid ""
"use the left and right <I=CAMERA> \n"
"to move your line of sight.  "
msgstr "用<I=CAMERA>左右键\n移动视线。"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x62a8fd/0x000001
#: olang/009c9ea4/0x62a97d/0x000001
msgid "Press <I=ACT> if you're ready to move on."
msgstr "准备好前进就按<I=ACT>。"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x62b8fd/0x000000
msgid ""
"Alright, let’s try up and down on\n"
" <I=CAMERA> one more time."
msgstr "好，再用<I=CAMERA>上下键\n试一次。"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x62b97d/0x000000
msgid ""
"Alright, let’s try left and right on\n"
"<I=CAMERA> one more time."
msgstr "好，再用<I=CAMERA>左右键\n试一次。"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x62bb7d/0x000004
msgid ""
"You have three stances:\n"
"stand, crouch, and lying down."
msgstr "有三种姿势：\n站、蹲、卧。"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x62bb7d/0x000005
msgid "To change stances use <I=STANCE>. "
msgstr "用<I=STANCE>切换姿势。"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x62bb7d/0x000006
msgid ""
"Tap <I=STANCE> to change \n"
"between standing and crouching."
msgstr "轻按<I=STANCE>在\n站姿和蹲姿间切换。"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x62bb7d/0x000007
msgid "You can move in either stance."
msgstr "两种姿势都能移动。"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x62bb7d/0x000008
msgid "Hold <I=STANCE> and keep it held to lie down."
msgstr "按住<I=STANCE>不放即可卧倒。"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x62c87d/0x000000
#: olang/009c9ea4/0x64687e/0x000000
msgid "What are you doing? "
msgstr "你在干什么？"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x62c87d/0x000001
msgid "Use <I=STANCE> to change your stance! "
msgstr "用<I=STANCE>切换姿势！"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x62c8fd/0x000000
msgid "Boss, change your stance with <I=STANCE>!"
msgstr "Boss，用<I=STANCE>切换姿势！"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x62cafd/0x000000
msgid ""
"What now? \n"
"Use <I=MOVE> to move!"
msgstr "怎么了？\n用<I=MOVE>移动！"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x62cbfd/0x000004
#: olang/009c9ea4/0x62cbfe/0x000004
msgid "To roll, tap <I=STANCE> while running."
msgstr "奔跑中轻按<I=STANCE>翻滚。"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x62cbfd/0x000005
msgid "You got that?"
msgstr "懂了？"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x62cbfe/0x000005
msgid "You got that? "
msgstr "懂了？"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x62cbfe/0x000006
msgid ""
"Tap <I=STANCE> while running. \n"
"Don't forget it!"
msgstr "奔跑中轻按<I=STANCE>。\n别忘了！"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x62d87d/0x000000
#: olang/009c9ea4/0x62d87e/0x000000
msgid ""
"What's wrong?! \n"
"Run with <I=MOVE>, \n"
"then press <I=STANCE> to roll!"
msgstr "怎么了？！\n用<I=MOVE>奔跑，\n再按<I=STANCE>翻滚！"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x62d87d/0x000001
msgid ""
"Run with <I=MOVE>,\n"
"then tap <I=ATK> to roll!"
msgstr "用<I=MOVE>跑，\n再按<I=ATK>翻滚！"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x62d87e/0x000001
msgid ""
"Run with <I=MOVE>, \n"
"then tap <I=STANCE> to roll!"
msgstr "用<I=MOVE>跑，\n再按<I=STANCE>翻滚！"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x62d9fd/0x000000
msgid ""
"To strike an enemy, \n"
"press <I=ATK> while standing still! "
msgstr "要攻击敌人，\n站住不动时按<I=ATK>！"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x62d9fd/0x000001
msgid ""
"On my command, press <I=ATK>\n"
"repeatedly and take down your opponent!"
msgstr "听我口令，连按<I=ATK>\n放倒对手！"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x62d9fe/0x000000
msgid ""
"To strike an enemy, \n"
"press <I=CQC> while standing still!"
msgstr "站立不动时按<I=CQC>\n攻击敌人！"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x62d9fe/0x000001
msgid "On my command,"
msgstr "听令，"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x62d9fe/0x000002
msgid ""
"press <I=CQC> repeatedly \n"
"and take down your opponent!"
msgstr "连按<I=CQC>\n放倒对手！"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x62dafd/0x000000
#: olang/009c9ea4/0x62dafe/0x000000
msgid "You alright, boss?"
msgstr "你没事吧，BOSS？"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x62dafd/0x000001
msgid "Press <I=ATK> without moving!"
msgstr "别动，按<I=ATK>！"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x62dafe/0x000001
msgid "Press <I=CQC> without moving!"
msgstr "别动，按<I=CQC>！"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x62db7d/0x000000
msgid "Press <I=ATK> without moving, Boss. "
msgstr "别动，按<I=ATK>，BOSS。"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x62db7e/0x000000
msgid "Press <I=CQC> without moving, Boss. "
msgstr "别动，按<I=CQC>，BOSS。"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x62dc7d/0x000000
#: olang/009c9ea4/0x62dc7e/0x000000
msgid ""
"To use the stun rod, \n"
"press <I=AIM> to ready it,"
msgstr "用电击棒时，\n按<I=AIM>举棒，"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x62dc7d/0x000001
#: olang/009c9ea4/0x62dc7e/0x000001
msgid "then press <I=ATK>."
msgstr "再按<I=ATK>。"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x64487d/0x000000
msgid "Hey, hey! Hold down <I=AIM>!"
msgstr "喂喂！按住<I=AIM>！"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x64487e/0x000000
msgid "Hey! Press <I=AIM>!"
msgstr "喂！按<I=AIM>！"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x6448fd/0x000000
msgid "Boss, please hold down <I=AIM>!"
msgstr "BOSS，请按住<I=AIM>！"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x6448fe/0x000000
msgid "Boss, please press <I=AIM>!"
msgstr "BOSS，请按<I=AIM>！"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x644a7d/0x000000
msgid ""
"What's wrong? Press <I=ATK>\n"
"while holding down <I=AIM>! "
msgstr "怎么了？按住<I=AIM>\n再按<I=ATK>！"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x644a7e/0x000000
msgid ""
"What's wrong? Press <I=ATK>\n"
"after pressing <I=AIM>! "
msgstr "怎么了？按<I=AIM>\n再按<I=ATK>！"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x644afd/0x000000
msgid ""
"Boss, please press <I=ATK> \n"
"while holding down <I=AIM>!"
msgstr "BOSS，请按住<I=AIM>\n再按<I=ATK>！"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x644afe/0x000000
msgid ""
"Boss, please press <I=ATK> \n"
"after pressing <I=AIM>! "
msgstr "BOSS，请按<I=AIM>\n再按<I=ATK>！"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x644bfd/0x000002
msgid ""
"and press <I=ATK> \n"
"while you tilt <I=MOVE>."
msgstr "再推<I=MOVE>\n按<I=ATK>。"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x644bfe/0x000001
msgid ""
"and press <I=CQC> \n"
"near an enemy as you tilt <I=MOVE>!"
msgstr "推<I=MOVE>靠近敌人\n按<I=CQC>！"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x6457fd/0x000000
msgid ""
"Hey! \n"
"Press <I=ATK> \n"
"as you tilt <I=MOVE>!"
msgstr "喂！\n推<I=MOVE>\n按<I=ATK>！"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x6457fd/0x000001
msgid "Press <I=ATK> as you tilt <I=MOVE>!"
msgstr "推<I=MOVE>按<I=ATK>！"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x6457fe/0x000000
msgid ""
"Hey! \n"
"Press <I=CQC>\n"
"as you tilt <I=MOVE>!"
msgstr "喂！\n推<I=MOVE>\n按<I=CQC>！"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x6457fe/0x000001
msgid "Hey! "
msgstr "喂！"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x6458fd/0x000001
msgid ""
"you have to press <I=ATK> \n"
"as you tilt <I=MOVE>!"
msgstr "倾斜<I=MOVE>时\n要按<I=ATK>！"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x6458fe/0x000001
msgid ""
"you have to press <I=CQC> \n"
"as you tilt <I=MOVE>!"
msgstr "倾斜<I=MOVE>时\n要按<I=CQC>！"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x645bfd/0x000000
msgid "To restrain your opponent, "
msgstr "要制服对手，"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x645bfd/0x000001
msgid "hold down <I=ATK> while near them. "
msgstr "靠近时按住<I=ATK>。"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x645bfe/0x000000
msgid "To restrain your opponent,"
msgstr "要制服对手，"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x645bfe/0x000001
msgid "hold down <I=CQC> while near them. "
msgstr "靠近时按住<I=CQC>。"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x645bfe/0x000002
msgid ""
"Restrain your opponent \n"
"on my command. \n"
msgstr "听我口令\n制服对手。\n"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x64687d/0x000000
msgid "What are you doing?"
msgstr "你在干什么？"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x64687d/0x000001
msgid "Press <I=ATK> while near your opponent! "
msgstr "靠近对手时按<I=ATK>！"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x64687e/0x000001
msgid "Press <I=CQC> while near your opponent! "
msgstr "靠近对手时按<I=CQC>！"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x6468fd/0x000000
#: olang/009c9ea4/0x6468fe/0x000000
#: olang/009c9ea4/0x64ab7e/0x000000
msgid "Boss, "
msgstr "BOSS，"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x6468fd/0x000001
msgid ""
"you have to press <I=ATK> \n"
"while next to your opponent! "
msgstr "在对手旁边时\n要按<I=ATK>！"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x6468fe/0x000001
msgid ""
"you have to press <I=CQC> \n"
"while next to your opponent!"
msgstr "在对手旁边时\n要按<I=CQC>！"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x646b7d/0x000001
msgid "press a direction on <I=MOVE> when you have them restrained."
msgstr "制服后按<I=MOVE>选方向。"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x647a7d/0x000000
#: olang/009c9ea4/0x647a7e/0x000000
msgid "To interrogate someone,"
msgstr "要审问对方，"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x647a7d/0x000001
#: olang/009c9ea4/0x647a7e/0x000001
msgid ""
"Press <I=ATK> to restrain \n"
"them, then press <I=INTERROGATE>."
msgstr "按<I=ATK>制服，\n再按<I=INTERROGATE>。"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x647bfd/0x000000
msgid "You OK? Press <I=ACT>!"
msgstr "没事吧？按<I=ACT>！"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x647bfe/0x000000
msgid "You OK? Press <I=INTERROGATE>!"
msgstr "没事吧？按<I=INTERROGATE>！"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x647c7d/0x000000
msgid "You have to press <I=ACT>, Boss!"
msgstr "BOSS，要按<I=ACT>！"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x647c7e/0x000000
msgid ""
"You have to press <I=INTERROGATE>, \n"
"Boss!"
msgstr "BOSS，\n要按<I=INTERROGATE>！"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x649a7d/0x000001
#: olang/009c9ea4/0x649a7e/0x000001
msgid "Then tilt <I=MOVE> to throw them."
msgstr "再倾斜<I=MOVE>扔出去。"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x649a7d/0x000002
#: olang/009c9ea4/0x649a7e/0x000002
msgid "By tilting <I=MOVE> toward other enemies,"
msgstr "把<I=MOVE>倾向其他敌人，"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x649a7e/0x000000
msgid "First, restrain an opponent by pressing <I=CQC> while near them."
msgstr "先靠近对手按<I=CQC>制服。"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x649bfd/0x000000
msgid ""
"Hey!\n"
"Tilt <I=MOVE> while \n"
"restraining the opponent!"
msgstr "喂！\n制服对手时\n倾斜<I=MOVE>！"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x649bfd/0x000001
msgid "Tilt <I=MOVE> while restraining the opponent! "
msgstr "制服对手时倾斜<I=MOVE>！"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x64a7fd/0x000000
msgid ""
"Tilt <I=MOVE> while restraining \n"
"the opponent, Boss!"
msgstr ""

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x64a97d/0x000001
msgid ""
"you'll have to take them on one \n"
"after the other."
msgstr "你必须一个接一个地\n对付他们。"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x64a97d/0x000003
msgid ""
"simply press <I=ATK> again \n"
"while throwing the current enemy.  "
msgstr "在投掷当前敌人时\n再次按下 <I=ATK>。"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x64a97e/0x000000
#: olang/00cd740b/0x64a97e/0x000000
msgid ""
"When you're surrounded \n"
"by multiple enemies,"
msgstr "当你被多个敌人\n包围时，"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x64a97e/0x000001
msgid ""
"you'll have to take them on one \n"
"after the other. "
msgstr "你必须一个接一个地\n对付他们。"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x64a97e/0x000002
msgid ""
"To do it, \n"
msgstr "为此，\n"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x64a97e/0x000003
msgid ""
"simply press <I=CQC> again \n"
"while throwing the current enemy."
msgstr "在投掷当前敌人时\n再次按下 <I=CQC>。"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x64a97e/0x000004
msgid ""
"Just be sure to wait for the Icon \n"
"to appear. \n"
msgstr "只要确保等待图标\n出现即可。\n"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x64aafd/0x000000
msgid "Press <I=ATK> when the Icon appears!"
msgstr "图标出现时按<I=ATK>！"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x64aafe/0x000000
msgid "Press <I=CQC> when the Icon appears! "
msgstr "图标出现时按<I=CQC>！"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x64ab7d/0x000000
msgid "Boss, press <I=ATK> when the Icon appears!"
msgstr "BOSS，图标出现时按<I=ATK>！"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x64ab7e/0x000001
msgid "press <I=CQC> when the Icon appears! "
msgstr "图标出现时按<I=CQC>！"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x68bb2b/0x01c78f
msgid ""
"Search with the conditions you have selected.\n"
"*Make sure your game is updated to the latest version."
msgstr "按所选条件搜索。\n*请确保游戏已更新至最新版本。"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x68bb2b/0x594dbd
msgid ""
"Search for MEMBERS with the conditions you have selected.\n"
"*Make sure your game is updated to the latest version."
msgstr "按所选条件搜索成员。\n*请确保游戏已更新至最新版本。"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x68bb2b/0xac71d5
msgid ""
"You can recruit CO-OPS MEMBERS worldwide online.\n"
"Select the type of invitation."
msgstr "你可以在线招募全球合作任务成员。\n选择邀请类型。"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x68bb2b/0xf6831d
msgid "Online multiplayer cannot be used by the current account."
msgstr "当前账号无法使用在线多人游戏。"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x6b2d56/0x48e16c
msgid "Open the ONLINE MANUAL?"
msgstr "打开在线手册？"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x74d55a/0x000000
msgid "Nukes!"
msgstr "核弹！"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x82e3c9/0x6fd5da
msgid "Press <I=DEC> to view the requirements that must be met."
msgstr "按<I=DEC>查看必须满足的条件。"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x840500/0x374a51
